# CMDEDIT-PAINT-15: Top with a child holding dnwell: select area dnwell; drop pwell; then with the child as edit cell (Q-CMDEDIT-17).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tinydw -noprompt
load a
load c
box 0 0 20 20
paint dnwell
save c
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell c
box -5 -5 25 25
select area dnwell
drop pwell
select clear
select cell c_0
edit
select area dnwell
drop pwell
writeall force
